{"suttaId":"thag6.9","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1880,1898],"vripara":"423"},"segments":{"thag6.9:0.4":"Purohitaputtajentattheragāthā","thag6.9:1.1":"“Jātimadena mattohaṃ, bhogaissariyena ca;","thag6.9:1.3":"Saṇṭhānavaṇṇarūpena, madamatto acārihaṃ.","thag6.9:2.1":"“Nāttano samakaṃ kañci, atirekaṃ ca maññisaṃ;","thag6.9:2.3":"Atimānahato bālo, patthaddho ussitaddhajo.","thag6.9:3.1":"“Mātaraṃ pitarañcāpi, aññepi garusammate;","thag6.9:3.3":"Na kañci abhivādesiṃ, mānatthaddho anādaro.","thag6.9:4.1":"“Disvā vināyakaṃ aggaṃ, sārathīnaṃ varuttamaṃ;","thag6.9:4.3":"Tapantamiva ādiccaṃ, bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhataṃ.","thag6.9:5.1":"“Mānaṃ madañca chaḍḍetvā, vippasannena cetasā;","thag6.9:5.3":"Sirasā abhivādesiṃ, sabbasattānamuttamaṃ.","thag6.9:6.1":"“Atimāno ca omāno, pahīnā susamūhatā;","thag6.9:6.3":"Asmimāno samucchinno, sabbe mānavidhā hatā”ti.","thag6.9:6.5":"… Jento purohitaputto thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-ii","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a2.att","from":1364,"to":1364,"paras":[{"para":1364,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag6.9:6"],"lines":["“Ahameva seṭṭho”ti pavatto māno <b>atimāno</b>.","“Ime pana nihīnā”ti aññe hīnato dahantassa māno <b>“omāno”</b>ti vadanti.","“Seyyohamasmī”ti pana aññaṃ atikkamitvā attānaṃ seyyato dahantassa pavatto seyyamāno <b>atimāno</b>.","“Hīnohamasmī”ti pavatto hīnamāno <b>omāno.</b>","<b>Pahīnā susamūhatā</b>ti heṭṭhimamaggehi pahīnā hutvā aggamaggena suṭṭhu samugghāṭitā.","<b>Asmimāno</b>ti “esohamasmī”ti khandhe “ahan”ti gahaṇavasena pavattamāno.","<b>Sabbe</b>ti na kevalaṃ atimānaomānaasmimānā eva, atha kho seyyassa seyyamānādayo navavidhā antarabhedena anekavidhā ca sabbe mānavidhā mānakoṭṭhāsā <b>hatā</b> aggamaggena samugghāṭitāti."],"lineRefs":[["thag6.9:6"],["thag6.9:6"],["thag6.9:6"],["thag6.9:6"],["thag6.9:6"],["thag6.9:6"],["thag6.9:6"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag6.9:6.1","atimāno",0,0],["thag6.9:6.1","omāno",0,1],["thag6.9:6.1","atimāno",0,2],["thag6.9:6.1","omāno",0,3],["thag6.9:6.1","pahīnā susamūhatā",0,4],["thag6.9:6.3","asmimāno",0,5],["thag6.9:6.1","hatā",0,6],["thag6.9:6.3","hatā",0,6],["thag6.9:6.3","sabbe",0,6]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
